    "Registration Step 3 Description": "Our experts will guide you in gathering the necessary documents, which may include passports and visa copies of shareholders and directors, a non-objection certificate (NOC) if applicable, and other specific documents depending on your chosen business structure and activity.",
    "Registration Step 4": "Determine Share Capital",
    "Registration Step 4 Description": "Depending on your business structure, you may need to specify the minimum share capital required for your company. We'll ensure you understand the capital requirements.",
    "Registration Step 5": "Obtain Initial Approval",
    "Registration Step 5 Description": "Our team will assist you in applying for initial approval from the relevant government department, such as the Discover Department of Economy and Tourism in Dubai (DED) or the respective Free Zone authority, depending on your chosen business location.",
